-# The ticket summary for an order's in-person (admission: in_person) tickets.
-# Rendered inside a paragraph by _performance_confirmation (which also appends
-# the late-seating note) and, with reminder: true, by _performance_reminder.
-# The confirmation version carries the charge sentence. The ticket total is
-# TicketOrder#attending_ticket_count: seat-holding in-person tickets plus
-# virtual ones, never non-seat add-ons such as drink vouchers. An order of only
-# add-ons has no total, so both versions drop the count rather than say
-# "0 tickets". The confirmation's pickup sentence counts only
-# TicketOrder#box_office_ticket_count (in-person, seat-holding tickets), and
-# drops the number when there are none ("Your tickets will be waiting").
- attending = order.attending_ticket_count
- if local_assigns[:reminder]
  - if attending.zero?
    Just a reminder, your order is for
  - else
    Just a reminder, you have
    = "#{attending} #{attending == 1 ? 'ticket' : 'tickets'}"
    at
  = order.performance.performance_time.strftime('%l:%M %p')
  this
  = "#{Date::DAYNAMES[order.performance.performance_date.wday]}."
  - unless order.performance.production.treat_as_special_event?
    We look forward to seeing you! Your tickets will be waiting at the box office under
    = order.hold_under.blank? ? 'your name' : order.hold_under
- else
  - if attending.zero?
    Your order is confirmed for
  - else
    We have
    = pluralize(attending, 'ticket')
    reserved for
  %i= "#{order.performance.production.name}#{!order.theater.is_default? ? ',' : ''}"
  = "presented by #{order.theater.name}" unless order.theater.is_default?
  on
  = "#{order.performance.performance_date.strftime('%A, %B %_d')}"
  at
  = "#{order.performance.performance_time.strftime('%l:%M %p')}."
  Your
  - pickup_count = order.box_office_ticket_count
  = pickup_count.zero? ? 'tickets' : pluralize(pickup_count, 'ticket')
  will be waiting at the
  = order.performance.production.treat_as_special_event? ? "door" : "box office"
  under
  - display_payment = order.hold_under.blank? ? 'your name' : order.hold_under
  - if !order.membership_payments.empty?
    = display_payment + " and were purchased with your #{order.membership_payments.first.membership.membership_offer.name}."
  - elsif !order.flex_pass_payments.empty?
    = display_payment + " and were purchased with your flex pass."
  - elsif order.customer_visible_total <= 0
    = display_payment + "."
  - else
    = display_payment + " and the total charge was $#{'%0.2f' % order.customer_visible_total}."
